{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ば", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437675.0192196}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "こちらで待たせていただきます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437677.9235828}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "で待ちますではなくて、ここで待たせていただきますだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437682.9625149}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "丁寧に自分の行為を相手に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437687.4575388}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "報告しています。ただし注意点があります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437690.608625}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "動詞のて形いただきます。これだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437695.35956}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "その行為は相手になってしまいます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437697.6687036}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "担当していただきますだと", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437701.5783007}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "相手に依頼する表現になてしまうので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437706.536705}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ここは注意が必要です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437707.4579535}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "自分の行為の場合は使役", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437712.5283449}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "でいただきますを使いましょう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437714.777351}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、それでは会話です。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437719.7779438}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "次の会話は、担当交代の挨拶の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437722.789177}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "会話になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437723.720255}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "では、今回も皆さんリピートしてください。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437727.7413676}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "もお世話になっております。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437730.938447}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "この度、御社の担当が変わりましたので", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437735.9801292}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任の者を連れてご挨拶", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437740.928123}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に参りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437743.1732376}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "はご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437748.1694427}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "が私の後任の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437752.9277318}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "チン・シュウメイでございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437754.7882204}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "私同様、よろし", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437759.8480105}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "お願いいします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437761.1097536}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "たび", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437766.1136584}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "御社を担当させていただくことになりました、チンでございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437769.5040233}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "チンさんですか。木村でございます。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437777.0487208}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437781.9845834}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "精一杯頑張りますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいします。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437789.475032}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ではもう一度内容を確認しましょう。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437796.2829225}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は、担当交代の挨拶", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437800.2079816}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "の会話になります。登場人物は三人", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437805.06954}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "永井さん木村さん、チンさんの三人になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437809.0608535}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は永井さんがいつもお世話になっております", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437814.04123}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "と会話を始めていますが", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437816.2298975}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "実はこの度御社の担当が変わりましたので、こう", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437821.1996932}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "任の者を連れてご挨拶に回りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437825.7401078}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任、これの意味は", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437828.0792522}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後の任務者、あとの担当者ということですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437833.159421}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "後任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437838.1316886}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "ですから", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437838.8309414}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "つまり永井さんは前任者", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437843.7689042}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "、今まで担当していた人ということになります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437847.5493698}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "は新しい担当者、後の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437851.4086618}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "任務者の人を連れて", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437853.6745403}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "一緒に二人で挨拶に来たという場面ですね。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437858.7465367}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "に対して木村さんが、それはご丁寧に", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437863.1130822}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入ります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437864.1997507}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入りますこれはすみませんの", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437869.2189198}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "丁寧ですね。すみませんの謙譲語になります。", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437873.3622417}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "恐れ入りますわざわざ", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437877.601216}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "挨拶に来てくれたことに対して、あ、それは", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437881.1163957}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "わざわざ丁寧に来てくださってありがとうございます", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437884.749267}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "という表現になります", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437885.6995103}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "source": "deepgram_final_ingress", "is_final": true, "raw_text": "から永井さん。こちらが私の後任の", "accepted_by_gate": true, "timestamp": 1783437890.695355}
